I see the issue! In the first loop that parses bit_length, there's a bounds check issue:

```c
for(w = 0, i = 0; w < HUFF_BC;) {
    // ...
    if(value == ESCAPE) {
        value = (p[i] & nibble_mask) >> nibble_shift;
        // ...
        if(value == 0) {
            bit_length[w++] = ESCAPE;
        } else {
